  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyyaani Sabato dabarraani, Mariamu Magdalenefi Mariamu haad'a Yakobotiifi Salomeni waan urgooftu bitani, aka d'aqani nafa Yeso dibani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba ganama guyya qara ka torbaani suni, eegi aduuni baate, fulla awaala d'aqani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan woliini jed'ani, Eentu d'akha afaani awaalati nuu gangalcha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Millannaani, d'akha guddo gudda kaani ka dudduubati gangalchani argani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awaala seenani, gurba kaima toko, ka woya adi uyifate gama mirgaa tau argani, guddo mamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni waan jed'e, Himamiina; isani Yeso Nazareti ka fannisani barbaaddani. Inni la kae, arma injiru! Ilaala, kuno, fulla isa qara kayani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 26.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 14.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo beena, jara isatiifi Petroti hima, Inni isani durati Galilaya d'aqa, achiti isa argitani jed'aani, akuma duri inni isaniti hime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nad'eeni taani sodaatte holatte kaate, fulla awaalati baqatte. Namunu womale injenne, maro sodaatteefi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mullacha d'ibi ta Yeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesoni ganama guyya qara ka torbaani duisa keesaa kae. Jennaani qara Mariamu Magdalene, ta inni jinni torba keesaa baase iti mullate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isiini d'at'e jara duri isa woliini jiruti himte, ato worri iye bohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo aka inni duisa keesaa kae, ammalle aka isiini isa argite d'ageennaani, d'ugefachu didani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso ergattu nama lamati mullata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi suni, Yesoni nama lamati bifa d'ibiini mullate, ato worri gara lafa oobru yau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri deebie, jara kaaniti hime, ammo d'ugefachu didani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesoni ergattu kudani tokoti mullata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi suni, Yesoni jara kud'ani tokoti mullate, ato worri sagale nyaatu. Inni worraani lole waan worri d'ugefacha d'abe, nama eegi inni duisa keesaa kae isa arge, worrati hime d'ugefachu dideefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.1.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Huji 1.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni waan worraani jed'e, Lafa ch'ufa keesa yaa, Odu Dansa nama ch'ufati odeesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami d'ugefate batifamu imbaafama, ammo ka ind'ugefanne wollaala iti murani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle akheekhi kuni worra d'ugefatu keesa mullata: maqa kiyyaani jinni nama keesaa baasani; afaani d'ibiini dubbatani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yo bofa harkaani qabani olfuud'ani, yokhaani had'ale d'ugani woma intahani; nama fayya inqamne harka ira kayani fayyisani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesoni gubbati oldeebia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.1.9+ACT.1.10+ACT.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Huji 1.9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi Aabbo bo Yesoni jara ufiti dubbate, inni gubbati oldeebie, harka Waaqa mirgaani tae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jari isaa yae, fulla ch'ufati dubbi Waaqa hasae; Aabboleeni worra woliini hojate dubbi jabeese, maro akheekha ka worri tolcheefi.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
